SUMMARY:EBR Seminar: Unlocking the Female Ribosome and the Epigenetic Androgen Clock
DESCRIPTION:Speaker: Professor Tim Hore (University of Otago, New Zealand)\nHost: Dr Doug Vernimmen\n\nTitle: "Unlocking the Female Ribosome and the Epigenetic Androgen Clock"\n\nProf Hore created the first successful knockout of rDNA in a vertebrate (Danio rerio), finding it effectively blocked female differentiation. Also works on the Androgen Clock, a predictor of long-term male hormone exposure in mammals based on DNA methylation profiles.
LOCATION:Roslin Institute Auditorium
ORGANIZER;CN=Douglas Vernimmen:mailto:douglas.vernimmen@roslin.ed.ac.uk
END:VEVENT
